====option-none (code='None')====
:'''{{para|format|option-none}}''' will allow {{para|iso-code|<nowiki>''None''</nowiki>, none, no}} (formatting is optional).

* {{tl|ISO 4217/code-none}} will return (show) {{para|iso-code|<nowiki>''None''</nowiki>}} (as formatted).

: Internally, {{tl|ISO 4217/code-none}} returns {{code|_NONE_}} ''or'' &lt;blank>. 

When code "None" is not allowed {{para|format|<s>option-none</s>}}, {{para|iso-code|None}} input is considered unrecognised code (returns blank). 
Will be categorised from mainspace, sorted under {{code|N}}.
:(In Template space: {{para|iso-code|None}} &rarr; {{ISO 4217/code|iso-code=None|format=ISO4217-cat}})
:See {{slink||maintenance-category ISO4217}}

