====The logic====
:{{para|iso-code}}, determines from ISO 4217. The code can be ambiguous.
:{{para|is-obsolete}}: yes/no (T/F), blank='unknown'
:{{tlx|yesno}} is applied: {{para|is-obsolete|no, false}}={{code|no}} (not obsolete, so ''active''), {{para|is-obsolete|''&lt;any text>''}} is {{code|yes}} (''obsolete'')

