'''Returns:''' when Obsolete, a text; when ''Active'', no text (blank). On can apply this as <code><nowiki>{{#if:{{code-is-obsolete|...}}|Obsolete|Active}}</nowiki></code>. 

The returntext is:
:When obsolete: 1. the {{para|is-obsolete|anytext}}; 2. the {{para|withdrawal-date}}, 3. {{para|obs-text|...}}, 4. "{{code|OBS}}"
:When active: 1. {{para|act-text|...}} 2. &lt;blank>
:Note that, by entering a ''blank'' {{para|obs-text|}}, the returntext ''will'' be a blank (so, same as default actual returntext!)


{{para|obs-text}}, {{para|act-text}} ''overwrites''.

;In {{tlx|Infobox currency}}
:For {{para|obsolete}}, {{para|obsolete}} of the infobox is used: {{para|1=obsolete|2=<nowiki>{{{obsolete|}}}</nowiki>}}

